1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
薄如纸，白如雪
Thin as paper, white as snow

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
广州人叫它，一匹白绸缎
Cantonese call it a bolt of white silk

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
肠粉
Rice noodle rolls — cheung fun

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,200
一勺米浆，浇上蒸盘
A ladle of rice batter onto the tray

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,400
几十秒，蒸成一层薄绸
Seconds later, a sheet of silk

6
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,600
刮起、卷好、淋豉油
Scraped, rolled, drizzled with soy

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,800
西关泮塘，荷仙馆创的布拉肠
Born at Poon Tong's Ho Sin Koon

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,000
布拉肠尝馅，抽屉肠尝粉
Cloth-pulled for filling, drawer for texture

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,200
广式早茶的头牌
The star of Cantonese morning tea

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,400
一碟肠粉，配一句「唔该」
A plate of cheung fun, and a soft m goi

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,600
你爱斋肠，还是牛肉肠？
Plain, or beef — which roll wins?

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,000
得闲饮茶，下集去西安
Yum cha soon — next stop, Xi'an
